  "prefLabel": "Nur 102.06 Attendance at Meetings By Members of the Public",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 102.06 Attendance at Meetings By Members of the Public. Pursuant to RSA 91-A:2, II, members of the public may attend and record board meetings except for those parts of the meetings which are nonpublic sessions pursuant to RSA 91-A:3.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at #1 chapter heading for Nur 100) #5887, eff 8-26-94; ss by #6778, eff 6-26-98; ss by #7736, eff 8-6-02; ss by #8777, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10296, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10569, eff 4-17-14",
